            "The critical path is **A → B → E → F → G**, with a total duration of 4 + 11 + 5 + 6 + 3 = **29 working days**. Data migration (D) is near-critical, with only 3 days of float, so it needs watching too. Training material (C) and communications (H) have plenty of float, so they can absorb delays or be scheduled around people's other work. Our guide to the [forward and backward pass](/project-management/forward-and-backward-pass/) explains the calculations step by step.",
            H3("How confident is the 29-day date?"),
